# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
input_methods/fcitx5/*.dll
*.so
!input_methods/rime/android/
!input_methods/rime/android/**/
!input_methods/rime/android/**/*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
*.syso
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

scripts/build
input_methods/rime/data

# 报告目录下的自训模型产物（24MB，研究资产不入库）
report/*.gram

# gram 训练管线工件：挖掘 TSV 与产物不入库（TSV hash 锁定在 tools/gram-train/SHA256SUMS.artifacts）
tools/gram-train/artifacts/
tools/gram-train/feed_wiki.txt
tools/gram-train/*.gram

# 2026-10-29: gram 实验产物与白盒素材不进仓（管线代码保留）
eval-workspace/
tools/gram-train/*.gram
tools/gram-train/*.txt
tools/gram-train/users/
tools/gram-train/users/
